{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a world full of monsters, fight terrifying monsters and monster bosses, challenge your way to new lands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen your heroes by developing skills, choose a class to join the battle against monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful and survive as long as you can in this desolate battlefield, fight until you defeat the boss in each area to enter the next new land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Legendary Heroes Survivals is a top-down platform roguelite game with a 2D solo battle mode where you fight against a large number of invading monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/game.gif?t=1744748515\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Survive the challenges in each level to defeat the boss in each level, collect coins to develop your own character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unlock new characters, 1 star and 2 star levels (must unlock 1 star before it will show) total 15 characters to challenge higher levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/char.gif?t=1744748515\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Develop and upgrade various abilities, totaling more than 10 types, to help our characters become even more capable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566580/extras/ability.gif?t=1744748515\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Use special skills unique to each character to fight for survival in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Challenge boss level monsters with unique abilities in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=